BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artist Talk: Dawit L. Petros
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261213T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261213T140000
UID:artist-talk-dawit-l-petros-2026-12-13t14-00-00-05-00@agakhanmuseum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/11
 /Biennial-Website-Image-scaled-aspect-ratio-1600-1000-scaled.jpg?resize=15
 84%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:How can water cataracts become anticolonial forces?\n\nJoin To
 ronto Biennial artist Dawit L. Petros in conversation with curator Allison
  Glenn\, where they will discuss Emergent Formations \, Petros’ new Bien
 nial commission for the Aga Khan Museum\, that considers the lasting impli
 cations of an 1884 British Empire military mission which set in motion an 
 extraordinary collision of worlds.\n\nThe Museum wishes to thank The Khimj
 i Foundation for their support of this installation.
LOCATION:Bellerive Room\, Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, O
 N M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/artist-talk-dawit-l-petros/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Metal Embossing: Patterns for the Page
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261227T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261227T110000
UID:metal-embossing-patterns-for-the-page-2026-12-27t11-00-00-05-00@agakha
 nmuseum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/11
 /Metal_Embossing_Bookmark_Shirin_Divanbeigi4-scaled-aspect-ratio-1600-1000
 -scaled.jpg?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Through this hands-on workshop\, discover the art of metal emb
 ossing inspired by the patterns and craftsmanship found in the Aga Khan Mu
 seum’s Collections.\n\nWorking with copper\, participants will learn sim
 ple yet effective techniques to shape and decorate metal surfaces. Guided 
 by our Museum Educators\, you’ll design and create your own embossed boo
 kmark\, exploring how artists across the Islamic world have transformed me
 tal into objects of both beauty and function for centuries.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/2026-holiday-metal-embossing/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
END:VEVENT
