 /Screenshot-2025-04-07-at-1.29.47PM-1-aspect-ratio-1600-1000.png?resize=15
 84%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Unleash your inner artist and turn an ordinary tote bag into a
  unique\, wearable masterpiece with patterns and decorations inspired by o
 bjects from the Aga Khan Museum Collections.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/2026-holiday-tote-bag-workshop/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
